{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"RecurringSalesOrders\">Recurring Sales Orders</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Pending\">Pending</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Automatic Create Custom Customer Customers On Orders Rate RecurringSalesOrder RecurringSalesOrders Sales SalesOrder SalesOrders To ToDate\">Recurring sales orders allow you to create sales orders that automatically generate on a predefined schedule for regular customers.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business Custom Customer Customers HasWhere Is Item On Repeat To ToDate\">This feature is ideal for subscription services, regular supply agreements, or any business arrangement where customers order the same items repeatedly.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Automatic Create Manual NewSalesOrder On Orders Sales SalesOrder SalesOrders To ToDate\">The system will automatically create new sales orders based on the frequency you set, saving time and reducing manual data entry.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Automatic Date Is Next On Rate Sales SalesOrder To ToDate Transaction\">Displays the scheduled date when the system will automatically generate the next sales order for each recurring transaction.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer Is Name RecurringSalesOrder Sales SalesOrder To ToDate\">Displays the customer name associated with each recurring sales order.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Contains Description Is On RecurringSalesOrder Sales SalesOrder Summary\">Displays the description or summary of what each recurring sales order contains.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount And Currency Custom Customer Is Item Line RecurringSalesOrder Sales SalesOrder Tax To ToDate Total\">Displays the total amount for each recurring sales order in the customer's currency, including all line items and applicable taxes.</p></div></details>",
